pressure: if V is a straight line in h with slope 6.8 A^3 > 0, then P*V favours lower h at first order (#70 Proposition):
the observed synthesis sequence 9R (ambient) -> 4H (3 GPa) -> 6H (5 GPa) -> 3C (18 GPa) (Jin et al.) runs down h step by step.
